abstract: >-
  An open, bilingual (English and Brazilian Portuguese) engineering reference for understanding modern foundation
  models below the interface layer. The project connects representations,
  tensors, objectives, architectures, inference, runtime, training, evaluation,
  retrieval, multimodality, agents, world models, security, and failure modes
  through equations, system-level relationships, and implementation-aware
  datasheets. The knowledge base is human-directed and AI-assisted; detailed
  production provenance is documented in PROVENANCE.md.
